  message: "Closed (owner-approved, root-cause sweep 2026-11-01 (dev b27eb0e0d0; lab ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/tracker_hygiene_sweep_2026-11-01T223538Z/)). Fixed by WI-jusah in PR #1983 (dev a1a0a8e7ae: luau takes an edge's source by position). Live repro today on dev b27eb0e0d0: outer() calls doA(), declares local function inner() calling doB() and function inner2() calling doA(), then calls inner(). analyze_luau emits calls outer->doA (line 4), inner->doB (line 6), inner2->doA (line 9), outer->inner (line 11): each nested call is credited to its own nested function, not to outer."  # b0cb
